# What the web host must NOT serve (gitignore syntax, read by Cloudflare Workers
# static assets). Netlify served the ENTIRE repo root — /README.md and every
# supabase/functions/*/index.ts were publicly downloadable. Nothing below is
# referenced by the app at runtime (grep-verified), and edge-function source,
# internal docs, and repo tooling do not belong on a public web host.
#
# _redirects and _headers are deliberately NOT listed: they must upload so the
# platform parses them, and Cloudflare never serves either publicly.
node_modules
.git
.gitattributes
.githooks
.github
.gitignore
.claude
.temp
.wrangler
supabase
scripts
# dev/ is the scan-fixture tooling. Both harnesses run against a LOCAL
# `python -m http.server` (dev/scan-fixtures/README.md), and their .glb fixtures
# are gitignored, so a deployed copy couldn't even run — nothing needs it served.
dev
package.json
package-lock.json
deno.lock
README.md
CLAUDE.md
SCHEDULING_SCOPE.md
# These two postdate the lines above and were serving 200 from every product host
# (caught 2026-08-20; they name the pilot tenant and internal call links).
# vendor/README.md is the one internal doc inside a directory that must upload.
INTERIOR_SCOPE.md
STRUCTURESTUDIO_3D_PLAN.md
vendor/README.md
# The OFFLINE compiler, and the only file in vendor/ that must NOT be served.
# `npm run compile` (scripts/compile.mjs) loads it from DISK in Node, so it stays
# in the repo — never .gitignore it, never delete it. No page has referenced it
# since 2026-08-13, when the app moved to committed compiled artifacts, but it
# kept uploading anyway and answered 200 on every product host: 2.85 MB of public
# surface nothing fetches (caught 2026-09-06). Preflight already refuses a
# babel-standalone <script> tag on the three pages; this is the same rule applied
# to the file itself. The other three vendor/*.min.js ARE served — the pages load
# React, ReactDOM and supabase-js from /vendor/ and must keep answering 200.
vendor/babel-standalone-7.23.9.min.js
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.beta.jsonc
.assetsignore
# Dev-only source mirrors — the browser loads the COMPILED artifacts; these are
# never fetched at runtime (FeedbackWidget import removed 2026-07-26; the per-page
# .jsx app sources compile to *.compiled.js via `npm run compile`, 2026-08-13).
# structure-studio.component.js stays SERVED on purpose: dev/scan-fixtures'
# measure-shipped.html slices the scan functions out of it, and the artifact
# drift gate proves it compiles byte-exactly into what customers run.
StructureStudio.jsx
FeedbackWidget.jsx
index.mount.jsx
portal/
admin.app.jsx
wrangler.beta2.jsonc
# First Workers Builds trigger: 2026-08-05 (deploy-freshness verification)
